@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/loop#> .

ex:A a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:B .
ex:B a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:C .
ex:C a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:A .
ex:D a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:C .
ex:p a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:C ; rdfs:range ex:A .
ex:q a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:B .
